      "rev_n_1_d249d2_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_1_d249d2_1",
        "node_id": "n_1_d249d2",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach was correct in its logic but failed to produce the expected output format. The issue lies in the way the roads are connected within the same gang and between different gangs. The current implementation connects districts within the same gang sequentially and connects the first district of each gang to the first district of the next gang. This approach may not always produce a valid solution, especially when there are multiple districts within a gang.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_1_d249d2_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_7e713a9467",
        "created_at": 1794527898.4665341
      },
      "rev_n_2_706a38_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_2_706a38_1",
        "node_id": "n_2_706a38",
        "thought_text": "The previous approach of connecting districts within the same gang and then connecting different gangs may not always produce a valid solution, especially when there are multiple districts in a gang. A more robust approach would be to use a graph coloring technique, where we assign colors (gangs) to districts and ensure no adjacent districts have the same color. This guarantees that all districts are connected while satisfying the condition that directly connected districts belong to different gangs.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_706a38_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_78a8f0314a",
        "created_at": 1794527937.9954147
      },
      "rev_n_3_ee6413_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_ee6413_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_ee6413",
        "thought_text": "The current approach using a disjoint set is correct, but we need to ensure that we're building exactly n-1 roads and handling the case where it's impossible to connect all districts. We should also fix the output formatting to match the expected result.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_ee6413_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_2d3ecbfe98",
        "created_at": 1794527981.23762
      },
      "rev_n_4_6162cb_0": {
